// B tiene dos semáforos: L1 y L2.
simulation S { duration 1 h }
intersection A at (0 m, 0 m)
intersection B at 100 m east of A
intersection C at 100 m east of B
road AB from A to B
road CB from C to B
light L1 at B {
	phase green for AB, CB during 30 s
}
light L2 at B {
	phase green for AB, CB during 30 s
}
